      <div className="ledger-totals"><div><span>Outstanding principal</span><strong>{rupees(totals.principal)}</strong><small>After allocated receipts and evidenced TDS</small></div><div><span>Calculated interest</span><strong>{rupees(totals.interest)}</strong><small>Through {date(claim?.as_of)}</small></div><div className="ledger-total-claim"><span>Total claim</span><strong>{rupees(totals.total)}</strong><small>Principal + calculated interest</small></div></div>
